A||||4||GT Bastard||Upper plenum bolts?? What size?||||1||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||05-15-2000||02:02 PM||||This sounds wierd, but I can't seem to find ANY socket to fit these damn bolts in the top on the intake.  What size are they????!!! I'm sure they aren't stripped either. It doesn't say the size in the Chiltons manual, but I have a pretty complete set of sockets and wrenches.  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Phil||05-15-2000||02:17 PM||||Use a 12 pt wrench or socket 10mm I think||||reg||1
Z||000002||GT Bastard||05-15-2000||05:42 PM||||Damn, I tried 9, 10, and 11mm socket in addition to all the non metric sockets.  Maybe they ARE round off. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||wilburt||05-15-2000||05:58 PM||||Phill's right, ya gotta make sure you're using a 12 POINT socket, not a 6 POINT. Most all are 10mm, and I think 1 or 2 8mm. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||GT Bastard||05-15-2000||06:37 PM||||Now I feel like a damn idiot... I've never had to use a 12-point socket.  Thanks man!||||reg||1
